# The hosted registry is a build artifact of `pnpm run registry`, generated from apps/lib.
# It is committed because raw.githubusercontent.com serves it directly and git tags are what
# give the hosted registry its permanent version pins — but it duplicates every byte of library
# source, so an unmarked diff would bury the actual change in ~1.1 MB of noise.
#
# `-diff` hides the content from `git diff`/`git log -p`; `linguist-generated` collapses it in
# GitHub PRs and keeps it out of language stats. Regenerate rather than hand-edit.
registry/** linguist-generated=true -diff

# Keep generated JSON from being rewritten by autocrlf on a Windows checkout — the CLI compares
# fetched content to files on disk, and a CRLF round-trip would make every file look modified.
registry/** -text
apps/lib/registry.json -text
